@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/[topic_uuid]/actions/read/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamTopicController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "Scope workers\nlease + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/{topic_uuid}/actions/read/invoke
API -> DB: 读取状态 + immutable outbox event\n每一个 exact-scope task
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: read_counters / folder_projection\n每一个 exact-scope task 有自己的 outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: 一个 fenced owner exact scope; 其他 scopes 它们是平行的
Worker -> Projection: 主题/流/文件连接计数器
Worker -> Events: topic.read + 容器事件\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
note over Worker,Projection
  Topic worker shared counters 他没有写.
  Atomic delta 要求 exactly-once guard; 否则 recompute/write.
  Retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper 必须.
end note
@enduml
